# Environment variables for the Personal Internship Finder.
#
# The backend keeps its example in backend/.env.example (server-only). Copy it to backend/.env.
# The frontend needs no variables: it calls relative /api URLs (proxied by Vite in development).
# Any future VITE_* variable would be PUBLIC (compiled into the browser bundle).
# Never commit real secrets. Never expose server-only keys to the browser.
